    "chunk_text": "h\u00e6lenda crist domine fili unigenite iesu christe. Lamb godes sunu f\u00e6der domine deus agnus dei filius patris. \u00d0u \u00fee ascyndest synna middangeardes gemiltsa us qui tollis peccata mundi miserere nobis. Synna middangeardes anfoh halsunga vel bene ure Qui tollis peccata mundi suscipe \u00deu \u00f0e sitest on \u00f0a swi\u00feran healfe f\u00e6deres gemiltsa us qui sedes ad dexteram patris miserere For\u00f0on \u00feu ana halig Quoniam tu solus sanctus. Drihten tu solus dominus. \u00deu se hehsta eala h\u00e6lenda crist tu solus altissimus iesu christe. Mid halgum gaste on wuldre godes & f\u00e6der gealag\u00eb vel sy swa cum sancto spiritu in gloria dei.",
